PROTOCOL SOURCES (clean-room implementation):

All protocol decoders in this project are clean-room implementations based
on publicly available protocol documentation. No source code from rtl_433
or other GPL-licensed decoder projects was used as reference material.

Sources used:
  - wmrx00 Oregon Scientific RF Protocols PDF (osengr.org)
  - aquaticus/nexus433 independent documentation (github.com/aquaticus/nexus433)
  - Hackaday reverse-engineering projects (hackaday.io)
  - Arduino Forum community reverse-engineering (forum.arduino.cc)
  - pilight protocol documentation - public specs (manual.pilight.org)
  - RCSwitch protocol documentation - public specs (github.com/sui77/rc-switch)
  - onetransistor.eu signal decoding guides
  - fetzerch.github.io reverse-engineering blog
  - tommie.github.io TX07K/WEC-2103 reverse-engineering
  - goughlui.com Efergy E2 reverse-engineering
  - platenspeler.github.io 433MHz transmitter documentation
  - sevenwatt.com WH1080 protocol documentation
  - Stack Overflow community reverse-engineering
